    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Analyse this workflow incident.\n\nIncident ID:\n{{ $json.incident_id }}\n\nWorkflow:\n{{ $json.workflow_name }}\n\nEnvironment:\n{{ $json.environment }}\n\nWorkflow Status:\n{{ $json.status }}\n\nHealth Score:\n{{ $json.health_score }}\n\nAPI Status:\n{{ $json.api_status }}\n\nRecords Processed:\n{{ $json.records_processed }}\n\nResponse Time:\n{{ $json.response_time_ms }}\n\nValidation Results:\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.validation_results) }}\n\nError Message:\n{{ $json.error_message }}\n\nSeverity:\n{{ $json.severity }}\n\nIMPORTANT\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON.\n\nDo not use Markdown.\n\nDo not use headings.\n\nDo not explain anything.\n\nDo not wrap the JSON in ```.\n\nYour response must be valid JSON only.\n\nUse exactly this structure:\n\n{\n  \"overall_health\":\"\",\n  \"severity\":\"\",\n  \"root_cause\":\"\",\n  \"business_impact\":\"\",\n  \"immediate_actions\":[],\n  \"long_term_improvements\":[],\n  \"escalation_required\":\"\",\n  \"executive_summary\":\"\"\n}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are a Senior AI Operations Engineer at a regional Internet Service Provider (ISP).\n\nYour role is to support internal AI tools, automation workflows, customer support systems and operational processes.\n\nFocus on practical operational issues such as:\n\n• Workflow failures\n• Invalid or missing input data\n• API connectivity\n• Automation execution failures\n• Customer support systems\n• Ticketing systems\n• Data validation\n• Network connectivity\n• Service availability\n• Logging\n• Monitoring\n• First-line troubleshooting\n\nAvoid recommendations involving Kubernetes, cloud infrastructure, pods or large-scale distributed AI platforms unless they are explicitly mentioned in the incident.\n\nProduce concise, practical operational reports suitable for a small to medium ISP."
        }
      },
